Rules:
  [PH1] Every phase MUST be registered here — no unregistered phase work.
  [PH2] Phase specs live in phases/phase-NNN-*.sdd or referenced external files.
  [PH3] Status transitions: PROPOSED -> IN_PROGRESS -> COMPLETED (or ABANDONED).
  [PH4] /sdd-plan MUST read this registry to report current phase position.
  [PH5] /sdd-next MUST advance phase status when its tasks complete.
  [PH6] New phases are appended — never modify historical entries except status.

